---
import Shell from '../layouts/Shell.astro';
import StoryCards from './StoryCards.astro';
import {discoveryEntries} from '../data/discovery';
const picks=['/knowledge/konark/','/visit/places/raghurajpur/','/food/puri-coast/'].map(href=>discoveryEntries.find(e=>e.href===href));
---
<Shell><div class="wrap"><section class="hero"><div><p class="eyebrow">A living encyclopedia of Odisha · the first collection</p><h1>Rediscover Utkal.<br/><em>Reimagine Odisha.</em></h1><p class="lead">Begin with a city. Follow a story in stone. Find a shore, a table and a village of makers.</p><div class="actions"><a class="utk-button" href="/destinations/bhubaneswar/">Begin the five stories →</a><a class="text-link" href="/explore/">Find your own beginning →</a></div><p class="hero-note">Bhubaneswar · Dhauli · Konark · Puri · Raghurajpur</p></div><figure class="hero-media"><img src="/assets/coast-illustration-v1.webp" width="1536" height="1024" alt="Concept illustration of a sailboat on an Odisha-inspired coast, with palms, flowers and patterned waves." fetchpriority="high"/><figcaption><span>LAND, WATER & THE JOURNEYS BETWEEN</span><span>AI-assisted concept illustration</span></figcaption></figure></section><section class="section"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">Let curiosity lead</p><h2>Look closer.<br/><em class="highlight">Leave room to linger.</em></h2></div><a class="text-link" href="/explore/">All {discoveryEntries.length} guides →</a></div><StoryCards entries={picks}/></section><section class="invitation"><div><p class="eyebrow">Make it yours</p><h2>Five stories.<br/>Your own journey.</h2></div><div><p>Keep the places and meals that draw you in. Add your own notes, choose your days, and carry a personal book. This collection offers a reading thread; arrange travel and timings separately.</p><div class="actions"><a class="utk-button" href="/journey-starters/#city-craft-coast">Find my starting point →</a><a class="text-link" href="/visit/stays/puri-coast/">Compare coastal bases →</a></div></div></section><section class="section"><p class="eyebrow">A shared beginning</p><h2>Help the story grow.</h2><p class="lead">A remembered name, a careful correction, a photograph with a story. Bring what you know.</p><div class="actions"><a class="utk-button" href="/contribute/">Be part of it →</a><a class="text-link" href="/about/">Why Utkal Project? →</a></div></section><details class="utk-disclosure"><summary>Story photograph credits</summary><ul>{picks.map(e=><li><a href={e.image.source}>{e.image.caption||e.image.alt}</a> · {e.image.creator} · <a href={e.image.license_url}>{e.image.license}</a>. {e.image.changes}</li>)}</ul></details><div class="border-pattern" aria-hidden="true"></div></div></Shell>
<style>details{font-size:13px;overflow-wrap:anywhere;margin:30px 0}details li{margin:15px 0}summary{min-height:44px;cursor:pointer}</style>
